# Purpose

This document defines the technical architecture of BizMate AI.

It establishes how the application is organized, how services communicate, how data flows through the system, and the architectural rules that every implementation must follow.

This document is the primary technical reference for developers and AI coding assistants.

---

# Architecture Overview

BizMate AI is an AI-first, offline-first, modular business platform.

The application follows a layered architecture.

```
Presentation Layer
        │
        ▼
Application Layer
        │
        ▼
Business Services
        │
        ▼
Rules Engine
        │
        ▼
AI Orchestration Layer
        │
        ▼
Data Access Layer
        │
        ▼
Local Storage + Supabase
```

Each layer has a single responsibility.

No layer should bypass another.

