# Event-Driven Architecture

BizMate AI uses an Event Bus to decouple services.

Example:

```
Sale Recorded
      │
      ▼
 Event Bus
      │
 ├── Dashboard
 ├── Timeline
 ├── Audit
 ├── Notifications
 ├── Synchronization
 └── AI Memory
```

Each service responds independently.

